			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710610201,
					"content": "將「觸媒」的能量分給了贊瑪蘭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710610202,
					"content": "嗚哇，大蘑頭亮起來了！現在是不是該叫「螢光大蘑頭」了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610203,
					"content": "#讚美{NICKNAME}，讚美派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610204,
					"content": "#多虧{NICKNAME}，多虧派蒙，贊瑪蘭重獲了生命的輝光。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610205,
					"content": "但切不可放鬆大意，贊瑪蘭知道，邪氣的源頭仍在，邪氣隨時可能再來襲擾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610206,
					"content": "欸，那該怎麼辦才好？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610207,
					"content": "嗚啊，哪裡冒出來的這些黑泥？這就是大蘑頭說的「邪氣」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7106103,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7106110
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7106110",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7106110,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 710610301,
					"content": "#讚美{NICKNAME}，讚美派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610302,
					"content": "贊瑪蘭的呼喚久久未得到回應。多腳的和四腳的自不必說，兩腳的也對贊瑪蘭的呼救置若罔聞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610303,
					"content": "#只有真正有智慧者才會回應贊瑪蘭的呼喚。派蒙是有智慧者，{NICKNAME}也是有智慧者。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610304,
					"content": "兩腳的之中的佼佼者理應獲得贊瑪蘭的感謝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610323,
					"content": "哼哼，「有智慧者」派蒙，不容小覷！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610305,
					"content": "小事一樁。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710610306,
					"content": "#相信假以時日，{NICKNAME}和派蒙也能成為與贊瑪蘭和贊瑪蘭的同族相提並論的存在。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610307,
					"content": "等等，大蘑頭這話是什麼意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610308,
					"content": "多腳的不如四腳的，四腳的不如兩腳的，自然兩腳的也不如無腳的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610309,
					"content": "#雖然{NICKNAME}和派蒙先天不足，但只要有心，後天的努力也未必不能改變運命的走向。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610310,
					"content": "不過是個螢光大蘑菇而已，竟然這麼囂張！不知道螢光蘑菇能不能做成料理…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610311,
						710610312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610311,
					"content": "野菇雞肉串應該不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710610312,
					"content": "漂亮的蘑菇都會騙人，一定有毒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710610313,
					"content": "派蒙胃口不小。今日吃蘑菇，明日吃蘑菇，百日之後派蒙之中已經不剩派蒙，只留蘑菇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610314,
					"content": "#嗚嗚，{NICKNAME}，大蘑頭講話好可怕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610315,
					"content": "唔，派蒙不懂幽默。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610316,
					"content": "這話一點也不幽默！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610317,
					"content": "贊瑪蘭擺脫了邪氣，同族卻仍在受苦。而今的贊瑪蘭力有不逮，無法像過去那般為弱者提供庇佑。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610318,
					"content": "#贊瑪蘭懇請{NICKNAME}，莫要吝惜哀憐，拯救無法自救的弱者吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "贊瑪蘭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610319,
					"content": "#意思是，還有其他的病怏怏的蘑菇嗎？{NICKNAME}，要不要幫幫它們呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610320,
						710610321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610320,
					"content": "來都來了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710610321,
					"content": "如果順路的話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710610322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710610322,
					"content": "那就快點出發吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710610207,
					"content": "嗚啊，哪裡冒出來的這些黑泥？這就是大蘑頭說的「邪氣」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
